{u}^{3}+{v}^{3} & =(u+v)({u}^{2}-uv+{v}^{2})\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186527139 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186527015 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186527139 #edb/ref 1069 "q-37554" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186527139 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186527139 #edb/ref 1071 "Factor the expression ${q}^{6}-27{d}^{3}.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186527139 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "246f9007-c107-5fa6-a212-74a6a9a70dc6" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186527139 #edb/ref 1074 "The difference of cubes formula is given by\n\n$$\n{a}^{3}-{b}^{3}=(a-b)({a}^{2}+ab+{b}^{2}).\n$$\n\nNotice that we can write our expression as a difference of cubes:\n\n$$\n{q}^{6}-27{d}^{3}={({q}^{2})}^{3}-{(3d)}^{3}\n$$\n\nNow, we factor the given expression using the difference of cubes formula:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{q}^{6}-27{d}^{3} & ={({q}^{2})}^{3}-{(3d)}^{3} \\\\  & =({q}^{2}-3d)(({q}^{2})^{2}+{q}^{2}\\cdot 3d+(3d)^{2}) \\\\  & =({q}^{2}-3d)({q}^{4}+3d{q}^{2}+9{d}^{2})\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186527151 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186527090 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186527151 #edb/ref 1069 "q-3529" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186527151 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186527151 #edb/ref 1071 "Factor $27{c}^{3}+1.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186527151 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "36ce6c6d-22d9-5124-bf0e-5ddb030e27ef" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186527151 #edb/ref 1074 "The sum of cubes formula is given by\n\n$$\n{a}^{3}+{b}^{3}=(a+b)({a}^{2}-ab+{b}^{2}).\n$$\n\nNotice that we can write our expression as a sum of cubes, as follows:\n\n$$\n27{c}^{3}+1=(3c)^{3}+{1}^{3}\n$$\n\nNow, we factor our expression using the sum of cubes formula:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}27{c}^{3}+1 & =(3c)^{3}+{1}^{3} \\\\  & =(3c+1)((3c)^{2}-3c\\cdot 1+{1}^{2}) \\\\  & =(3c+1)(9{c}^{2}-3c+1)\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186527213 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186527120 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186527213 #edb/ref 1069 "q-3601" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186527213 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186527213 #edb/ref 1071 "Factor $1-{j}^{3/2}.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186527213 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "d6fb18a1-0afa-52ee-a564-35b978a84f8b" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186527213 #edb/ref 1074 "The difference of cubes formula is given by\n\n$$\n{a}^{3}-{b}^{3}=(a-b)({a}^{2}+ab+{b}^{2}).\n$$\n\nNotice that we can write our expression as a difference of cubes:\n\n$$\n1-{j}^{3/2}={1}^{3}-{({j}^{1/2})}^{3}={1}^{3}-{(\\sqrt{j})}^{3}\n$$\n\nNow, we factor the given expression using the difference of cubes formula:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}1-{j}^{3/2} & ={1}^{3}-{(\\sqrt{j})}^{3} \\\\  & =(1-\\sqrt{j})({1}^{2}+1\\cdot \\sqrt{j}+(\\sqrt{j})^{2}) \\\\  & =(1-\\sqrt{j})(1+\\sqrt{j}+j)\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186527225 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186527071 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186527225 #edb/ref 1069 "q-112336" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186527225 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186527225 #edb/ref 1071 "Factor $\\frac{{u}^{3}}{8}-1.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186527225 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "ee3cc387-c8ba-5e21-b6bf-54f77512a2c2" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186527225 #edb/ref 1074 "The difference of cubes formula is given by\n\n$$\n{a}^{3}-{b}^{3}=(a-b)({a}^{2}+ab+{b}^{2}).\n$$\n\nNotice that we can write our expression as a difference of cubes, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\frac{{u}^{3}}{8}-1={(\\frac{u}{2})}^{3}-{1}^{3}\n$$\n\nNow, we factor our expression using the difference of cubes formula:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{u}^{3}}{8}-1 & ={(\\frac{u}{2})}^{3}-{1}^{3} \\\\  & =(\\frac{u}{2}-1)({(\\frac{u}{2})}^{2}+\\frac{u}{2}\\cdot 1+{(1)}^{2}) \\\\  & =(\\frac{u}{2}-1)(\\frac{{u}^{2}}{4}+\\frac{u}{2}+1)\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186527226 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186527099 #edb/ref 175921860